  <page_number>68</page_number>
  <running_head>I. IACOMOTI</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">POPPÆ tractus, cui virescet Aonia caput usque fronde.</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Laus specillorum.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">
      <i>HIc laudis meruit decus peremne,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" para="true">
      <i>Qui vitri geminos nutentis orbes</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">
      <i>Primus, eximiæ Magister artis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6" para="true">
      <i>Nasis turgidulis micare iussit</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7" para="true">
      <i>Pendentes, vitreis, nouisque ocellis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8" para="true">
      <i>Ceu bina face solibúsque binis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9" para="true">
      <i>Vel ceu splendidulis inuare flammis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" para="true">
      <i>Languentes oculos, tenebricosos,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11" para="true">
      <i>Annosos simul, atque lippientes,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12" para="true">
      <i>Doctus: quum senio retusus hebet</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13" para="true">
      <i>Visus, pupula quum stupet tenella</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">
      <i>Morbo debilitata sanitate.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15" para="true">
      <i>Artis qui Medicæ peritiores</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">
      <i>Machaon, Podalyriúsque frater,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17" para="true">
      <i>Illorúmque parens vel ipse Chiron,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18" para="true">
      <i>Ausi temporibus prioris ævi</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" para="true">
      <i>Herbarum varias docere vires,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20" para="true">
      <i>Et collyria Lumini tuendo,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21" para="true">
      <i>Nescuere vitri micantis visus.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">
      <i>Hic Sparsos oculi coercet ignes,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23" para="true">
      <i>Extinctos revocat, novo &amp; latenti</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24" para="true">
      <i>Sopitos vegetans vigore sensus,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" para="true">
      <i>Et longo recreat labore fessos.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26" para="true">
      <i>Vitreis</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Faint show-through from the facing page is not transcribed. Catchword "Vitreis" is at the lower right of the text block; the signature mark "E 2" near the foot is faint and uncertain.</notes>
